(* Pia.Float.Exp (ADR 0067, X2): every goal of the module is proved, among
   them exp's error against the real exp, and both of its lemmas given
   `by lean`, the model of RealExp and scaled_lin, are proved by their
   receipts, so nothing is trusted. Its interface gives exp's range.
// RUN: FileCheck %s < %S/../../lib/Pia/Float/exp.goals
// RUN: piac --emit=interface -o %t %S/../../lib/Pia/Float/Exp.pia
// RUN: FileCheck --check-prefix=IFACE %s < %t/Pia.Float.Exp.Exp.piai
*)

